WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:07.920
Yes, totally. I feel that happiness is something you build up over time.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.300
And well, I've worked on building that happiness little by little.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.420
Maybe there are moments when I sometimes feel a bit of tiredness.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.840
Right now I don't see it as sadness, but sometimes it's more like a tiredness that hits you.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.040
And that's what reminds you that you have to keep fighting to keep being happy every day.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:39.400
So when you start living your dreams, you start working more on the thing you always dreamed of, you stop working just to start enjoying it.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:48.280
So you live and you enjoy, and at the same time you're doing what you always dreamed of, and that's the beautiful part.
